{"last_link_id": 88, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [39], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [350.6952209472656, 274], "pos": [-4880.9921875, -4865.83935546875], "widgets_values": ["append", "yes", "按照元指令", "", "只输出最终的提示词，不要带任何解释和说明性的废话，直接从**Prompt (English):**往下的提示词给我就可以", "按照元指令, 基础提示词：提取图1风格，根据用户对场景的要求，生成适合图2产品的场景，并将图二产品替换到海报（保持海报的排版边框）当中。 场景要求:\n明亮温馨的客厅，铺着一块短绒地毯。\n宠物状态： 画面主体包含一只可爱的小型犬（如柯基、马尔济斯或比熊），小狗正趴在地板上好奇但不害怕地看着扫地机，或者正在自己的狗窝旁睡觉。 视觉要点： 机器状态与角度： 机器状态与角度： 扫地机正在清理小狗周边的散落狗粮或肉眼可见的宠物毛发。画面要传达“人宠和谐、静音不惊扰、强力吸毛”的感觉。 排版要求：顶部“dJI大疆官方旗舰店”保持不变\n产品名：DJI ROMO\nslogan:大疆首款旗舰拖扫机器人\n立即抢购\n保持原有的字体与字体大小不变。, 只输出最终的提示词，不要带任何解释和说明性的废话，直接从**Prompt (English):**往下的提示词给我就可以"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "action"}, "name": "action", "label": "action", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "action"}, {"widget": {"name": "tidy_tags"}, "name": "tidy_tags", "label": "tidy_tags", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "tidy_tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "text_a"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text_a", "label": "text_a", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_a"}, {"widget": {"name": "text_b"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text_b", "link": 17, "label": "text_b", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_b"}, {"widget": {"name": "text_c"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text_c", "label": "text_c", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_c"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 14, "type": "StringFunction|pysssss", "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text_b": true}, "Node name for S&R": "StringFunction|pysssss"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [372.91351318359375, 728.4478759765625], "pos": [-4490.03857421875, -5314.130859375], "widgets_values": ["**Prompt (English):**\nProfessional e-commerce KV poster, 9:16 vertical aspect ratio, high-end lifestyle photography style. **Scene:** A bright and warm modern living room with soft natural sunlight streaming through a window. On a premium beige short-pile carpet, a cute white Maltese dog is lying down comfortably, looking curiously and calmly at the robot vacuum. **Product Display (Strictly Restore Image 2):** The DJI ROMO robot vacuum is in the foreground, showing its sleek white circular body with a signature transparent top cover revealing the sophisticated internal mechanical structure and the silver \"ROMO\" metal plate. The robot is actively cleaning fine pet hair and scattered kibble on the carpet. **Atmosphere:** Quiet, harmonious, and high-tech. \n\n**Layout & Typography (Strictly follow Image 1 style):**\n- **Top Left (Brand):** DJI Logo followed by \"大疆官方旗舰店\" in black sans-serif font.\n- **Top Left (Title):** Below the brand, \"DJI ROMO\" in large, bold, modern black sans-serif font.\n- **Top Left (Slogan):** Directly below the title, \"大疆首款旗舰拖扫机器人\" in medium-sized black sans-serif font.\n- **Top Left (CTA Button):** An orange rounded capsule button (#FF8C00) with white text \"立即抢购\", maintaining the exact proportions and font size from the reference image.\n\n**中文布局说明：**\n- **文字位置：** 延用图1逻辑，所有文本与按钮均位于画面左上角 1/4 区域，左对齐。\n- **字号阶梯：** \n  1. 品牌标：DJI Logo + 大疆官方旗舰店 (小号)\n  2. 主标题：DJI ROMO (特大号，粗体)\n  3. 副标题：大疆首款旗舰拖扫机器人 (中号)\n  4. 按钮：立即抢购 (橙色圆角矩形，白字)\n- **颜色方案：** 保持背景明亮（米色、原木色、白色），文字采用纯黑 (#000000)，按钮采用活力橙 (#FF8C00)。\n- **字体风格：** 现代无衬线体（类似 DJI 官方定制字体或黑体），线条干练。\n\n**CTA按钮/LOGO位置：** \n- 品牌入口位于左上角起始点。\n- 视觉出口为左侧橙色“立即抢购”按钮。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 31, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [28], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [346.17474365234375, 723.1066284179688], "pos": [-5257.40185546875, -5314.5234375], "widgets_values": ["我需要为我的产品生成电商KV（Key Visual）视觉系统提示词。\n\n第一步：产品信息智能提取（如果上传了图片）\n请仔细分析我上传的产品图片，自动提取以下信息并整理为【识别报告】：\n\n品牌名称识别： 识别LOGO文字（中文/英文）、提取设计风格（字体、配色）。\n\n产品类型判断： 识别所属类别、具体名称、规格（尺寸、容量等）。\n\n卖点提取： 从文案、图标（如有机、无添加）或视觉特征（材质、工艺）中提取核心卖点。\n\n配色方案分析： 提取主色调（RGB/HEX）、辅助色，分析配色风格。\n\n设计风格判断： 识别包装风格（极简、复古、科技等）与字体/图案元素。\n\n目标受众推断： 根据视觉风格推断用户画像、年龄段及消费层级。\n\n产品细节识别： 识别材质（哑光、高光）、结构特点（泵头、自封袋等）。\n\n输出格式：\n\n【识别报告】\n品牌名称：[中文] / [英文]\n产品类型：[大类] - [具体产品]\n核心卖点：[卖点1-5，中文描述]\n主色调：[名称] (#HEX) | 辅助色：[名称] (#HEX)\n设计风格：[风格描述]\n目标受众：[用户画像]\n品牌调性：[调性描述]\n\n第二步：视觉风格选择\n基于识别信息推荐或由用户指定：\n\n杂志编辑风（高级、大片感、粗衬线标题）\n\n水彩艺术风（温暖、柔和、手绘感）\n\n科技未来风（冷色调、几何、数据可视化）\n\n极简北欧风（大留白、黑白灰、几何感）\n\n自然有机风（植物元素、大地色、环保感）\n\n第三步：文字排版布局选择\n排版要求： 默认使用中文排版。排版形式应参考上传图片的构图或用户特定需求。\n\n经典对齐： 粗体中文大标题 + 细线装饰 + 网格对齐。\n\n现代悬浮： 玻璃拟态卡片 + 半透明背景 + 柔和圆角。\n\n艺术标注： 手写体中文说明 + 水彩/涂鸦元素 + 不规则散点布局。\n\n极简留白： 极细中文线条字 + 大量负空间 + 精确对齐。\n\n层级对比： 特大号标题文字 + 极小号标注文字，形成视觉张力。\n\n第四步：海报主题选择\n请从以下主题中选择（如：海报01-主KV、海报02-场景图、海报03-工艺概念、海报04-细节特写等）。\n\n生成要求（核心规则）\n产品图还原：\n\n必须在Prompt中明确：“严格还原上传的产品图，保持LOGO位置、包装图案、配色及文字内容完全一致。”\n\n保持产品的真实材质感（如哑光磨砂或金属高光）。\n\n中文排版逻辑：\n\n标题： 采用纯中文大标题。根据风格选择字体（如：高端产品用宋体/衬线体，科技产品用黑体/无衬线体）。\n\n卖点排版： 使用中文短句，配合小图标或符号引导。\n\n布局逻辑： * 若参考图为居中构图，文字应对称分布。\n\n若参考图为对角线构图，文字应占据留白处（通常为左上或右下）。\n\nPrompt输出结构：\n\n✅ English Prompt： 完整详细的Midjourney/DALL-E格式提示词（描述场景、光影、产品细节）。\n\n✅ 中文布局说明：\n\n文字具体位置（如：左侧1/3处）。\n\n字号阶梯（主标题 > 副标题 > 卖点文字 > 品牌声明）。\n\n颜色方案（使用提取的HEX色值）。\n\n字体风格描述（如：坚硬的方体、柔和的手写体）。\n\n✅ CTA按钮/LOGO位置： 明确标识品牌视觉出口。\n### 海报01｜主KV·水彩猫咪的幸福时刻（Hero Visual）\n\nPrompt (English): \n\nPrompt (English): \n9:16 vertical premium artistic poster, watercolor illustration style. Soft natural lighting, warm off-white background with subtle blue and yellow watercolor wash edges. Center: An exquisite watercolor-style real cat (British Shorthair or orange tabby), fine fur detail, bright expressive eyes, happily eating freeze-dried chicken pieces (actual product), surrounded by abstract watercolor petals and feather decorative elements (blue, yellow, pink). \n\nProduct Display (Strictly Restore Uploaded Image): RANOVA freeze-dried chicken product packaging elegantly placed beside cat, 45-degree angle showing front design. Must completely restore all packaging design elements: \n- Blue gradient bag body (#4A90E2 primary color) \n- Front watercolor-style cat head illustration (blue and yellow wash) \n- Top golden brown \"RANOVA\" brand logo and Chinese \"朗诺\" \n- Middle white area \"宠物零食 冻干鸡肉\" text \n- Bottom icon area: blue \"100%纯肉\" icon, green \"无谷物\" icon, pink \"不含诱食剂\" icon \n- Bottom-right \"净含量：300克\" notation \n- Packaging material: matte plastic bag with zip-lock \n\nLayout (Bilingual Chinese-English Design): \n\nTop-left: \n- RANOVA watercolor logo (small, approximately 5% of canvas width) \n\nTop center: \n- Main title (watercolor brush texture, Chinese-English stacked layout):\n  - Line 1: \"纯肉冻干\" (golden brown #C49A6C, bold serif font, size 30% of canvas width)\n  - Spacing between Chinese and English: 0.5x Chinese text size \n- Subtitle (after thin line decoration):\n  - \"每一口都是真材实料\" (golden brown, Song font, small size)\n \nLeft-center: \n- Glassmorphism info card (20px rounded corners, semi-transparent white base, 10px blur, 3 key points, icon + bilingual):\n  - Point 1:  \n    - Icon: 🥩 (meat emoji)  \n    - Chinese: \"100%纯肉\" (dark gray #2D2D2D, bold, 14pt)  \n    - English: \"100% Pure Meat\" (medium gray #666666, regular, 11pt)    - Layout: Chinese and English separated by slash \"/\" on same line\n  - Point 2:  \n    - Icon: ❄️ (ice crystal emoji)  \n    - Bilingual: \"冻干锁鲜\n  - Point 3:  \n    - Icon: 🌾 (wheat emoji with red X)  \n    - Bilingual: \"无谷配方\n  - Card padding: 20px all sides\n  - Point spacing: 15px \n\nBottom-right: \n- Rounded pill CTA button (golden brown bg #C49A6C, white text):\n  - Button size: width 25% of canvas, height 25% of width\n  - Button radius: 50% of height (fully rounded)\n  - Text (Chinese-English parallel): \"立即为爱宠选购 →\"\n  - Chinese 12pt, English 10pt, arrow 12pt\n  - Button position: 5% from right edge, 8% from bottom\n\n---\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 9, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [30, 34], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "color": "#048470", "widgets_values": ["cf6b157a00999e16f0b3281177a68a4ea441762a0a646a2428d627082203fec8.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#02483d", "size": [440.00323486328125, 804.0430908203125], "pos": [-4784.56396484375, -6221.24072265625], "id": 11, "properties": {"#sdppp_simple_content": "canvas", "#sdppp_label": "", "#sdppp_variant": "default", "#sdppp_simple_boundary": "canvas", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "#sdppp_simple_mask": "canvas", "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [31, 35], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [400, 398], "pos": [-4901.3427734375, -5313.77587890625], "widgets_values": ["gemini-3-flash-preview", "You are a helpful